      "widgets_values": [
        "A cinematic realistic portrait video of a young woman standing on a quiet city street at golden hour. She has distinctive shoulder-length red hair, natural makeup, expressive eyes, and wears a modern black jacket over a simple fitted top. She looks toward the camera, then glances to the side as a light breeze moves her hair and clothing naturally.\n\nCamera: medium close-up to medium shot, shallow depth of field, subtle handheld movement, natural lens breathing, realistic skin texture, soft background bokeh.\n\nAction: she shifts her weight, lightly brushes hair away from her face, gives a subtle relaxed expression, then turns slightly toward the street. Natural body motion, believable blinking, breathing, hair movement, and fabric motion.\n\nEnvironment: contemporary urban street, warm sunset light, soft reflections on windows, a few distant pedestrians and cars moving naturally in the background.\n\nStyle: high-end live-action photography, realistic human proportions, detailed face and hands, natural skin, cinematic but not overly stylized, no exaggerated beauty filter, no artificial plastic texture.\n\nAudio: soft city ambience, distant traffic, light footsteps, faint wind, no dialogue.\n\nNo text, subtitles, logos, watermarks, animation, cartoon rendering, distorted hands, duplicated people, or abrupt camera motion.\n",
