      "title": "接続と操作 / v1.1.0",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## H3 Preview / Continue — No BBOX\n\n1. Select your installed H3 model, text encoder, video/audio VAEs and compatible Turbo LoRA.\n2. Enter a prompt and click Preview to review a predicted first frame.\n3. To try again, change the seed and generate a new Preview.\n4. Click GO to continue the same generation through Decode and Save.\n\nDefaults: Euler / simple, 6 total steps, 3 preview steps, 24 fps, approximately 5 seconds.\nNo BBOX or Structured Canvas nodes are required. Model files must be installed separately.\nThis template has been checked structurally for distribution; it has not been rerun on GPU as part of this addition."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "## H3 Draft Sampler / Continue Sampler\n\n標準SamplerCustomAdvancedの前後だけを置換します。\n上流: MODEL+LoRA / conditioning / NOISE / SAMPLER / SIGMAS / LATENTを既存Workflowで作成。\n下流: output LATENTを既存Video/Audio VAE Decode → CreateVideo → SaveVideoへ接続。\n\n1. Preview: Frame 0を1枚確認。\n2. NG: New seed + Preview（外部RandomNoiseのseedのみ変更）。\n3. OK: GO。残りsigmaから続行し、接続されたDecode/保存先を実行。\n\n初期値: 同じ4-step Turbo / 6 total / 3 preview / Euler。追加pip依存なし。\n現在はEulerのみ。res_multistep等へ勝手に置換しません。\nReference/Guide/BBOXプロンプトは、このペアより上流のnative conditioningへ。\nこの新しい接続版の実GPU・実UI・参照あり品質は未検証。旧2ノードは変更しません。"
      },
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
